title: Economic efficiency
is-card: true
new-page: true
on-arrival: economic_democracy_timer += 10; month_actions += 1
view-if: kcp_in_government and (finance_minister_party == "KCP") and (labor_minister_party == "KCP") and economic_democracy_timer <= 0
card-image: img/mof-kadja.png
max-visits: 8
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
#subtitle: How can we improve workers efficiency?

= Economic Democracy

We need to improve economic efficiency and workers satisfaction.

- @expand_councils
- @expand_councils_2
- @expand_councils_3
- @cooperatives_1
- @return: Do not enact any policies for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@expand_councils
title: Establish trade union councils.
subtitle: The trade union councils will bolster our worker efficiency.
view-if: works_councils == 0
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; workers_kcp += 7*(1-dissent); works_councils += 1; socialist_dissent -= 6; socialist_strength += 8; up_relation += 5; economic_growth += 0.4;
max-visits: 1

Establish trade union councils for regular work schedules.

@expand_councils_2
title: Increase worker oversight.
subtitle: This is a step towards a efficient workers democracy.
view-if: works_councils == 1
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; workers_kcp += 7*(1-dissent); works_councils += 1; socialist_dissent -= 6; socialist_strength += 8; up_relation += 5; economic_growth += 0.1 if economic_growth < 3
max-visits: 1

We have never realy tried large scale worker democracy with goverment oversight , time to change that.

@expand_councils_3
title: Empower sectorial works councils.
subtitle: Give works councils a role in setting wage and price policy for entire industrial sectors.
view-if: works_councils == 2
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; workers_kcp += 7*(1-dissent); capital_strike_progress += 1; works_councils += 1; socialist_dissent -= 6; socialist_strength += 8; up_relation += 5;
max-visits: 1

Sectorial works councils can now negotiate wage and price policies for entire economic sectors, helping to both give workers more of a voice, and to rationalize the economy, smoothing over the anarchy of the market.

@cooperatives_1
title: Support worker and consumer cooperatives.
subtitle: -1 budget
on-arrival: economic_democracy += 1; cooperatives += 1; workers_kcp += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_kcp += 4*(1-dissent); budget -= 1; unemployed -= 1 if unemployed > 9; economic_growth += 0.2
choose-if: budget >= 1
max-visits: 3

We have enacted legislation that makes it easier to create cooperative enterprises of all sorts, and provide financial support to struggling cooperatives.
